## 3. Database Schema Single Source of Truth

The verified schema facts have been reconciled as the single source of truth across all code and database functions:

```
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                              CANONICAL TENANT MAPPING                                 |
+--------------------------+-----------------------+------------------------------------+
| Entity / Table           | Column & Data Type    | Description / Mapping              |
+--------------------------+-----------------------+------------------------------------+
| public.schools           | id: UUID              | Canonical Surrogate Key            |
| public.schools           | code: TEXT UNIQUE     | Human-Readable Code (e.g. GW-01)   |
| public.profiles          | school_id: UUID       | References public.schools(id)      |
