+--------------------------+-----------------------+------------------------------------+
```

### Database Tenant Resolution Functions
1. `public.get_current_tenant_uuid() RETURNS uuid`: Resolves the UUID of the authenticated school.
2. `public.get_current_tenant_code() RETURNS text`: Resolves the TEXT school code (e.g. `CAMPUS-01`, `ALPHA`).
3. `public.get_current_tenant_id() RETURNS text`: Returns the primary tenant identifier string.

RLS policies on text-based tables enforce:
```sql
