-- ==============================================================================
-- SUPABASE MIGRATION: 21_security_and_financial_hardening.sql
-- Production Security Remediation & Financial Correctness Hardening (v3 - Schema Reconciliation)
-- Project: Academic OS (Multi-Tenant EduSaaS)
